Route21_South_Text_JackIntro::
	.string "I caught my\n"
	.string "Pokemon at sea.\p"
	.string "Last week something\n"
	.string "caught me.\p"
	.string "It let me go.\p"
	.string "I don't know why.$"

Route21_South_Text_JackDefeat::
	.string "Neither do I.$"

Route21_South_Text_JackPostBattle::
	.string "I'm grateful.\p"
	.string "I just wish\n"
	.string "I knew what\p"
	.string "it wanted.$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromeIntro::
	.string "I'm in a\n"
	.string "triathlon.\p"
	.string "Swim, bike, run.\p"
	.string "I've been swimming\n"
	.string "this section for\p"
	.string "an hour.\p"
	.string "The shore keeps\n"
	.string "moving.$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromeDefeat::
	.string "Still moving.$"

Route21_South_Text_JeromePostBattle::
	.string "Beat me and\n"
	.string "maybe the shore\p"
	.string "will stay still.$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandIntro::
	.string "Feel the sun\n"
	.string "and the wind.\p"
	.string "The wind here\n"
	.string "blows from a\p"
	.string "direction that isn't\n"
	.string "on any compass.$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandDefeat::
	.string "You felt it.$"

Route21_South_Text_RolandPostBattle::
	.string "It comes from\n"
	.string "somewhere the maps\p"
	.string "don't show.$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudeIntro::
	.string "Don't scare the fish.\p"
	.string "Something already\n"
	.string "did.\p"
	.string "Nothing has bitten\n"
	.string "for two days.$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudeDefeat::
	.string "Still nothing.$"

Route21_South_Text_ClaudePostBattle::
	.string "The fish went\n"
	.string "deep.\p"
	.string "They know something\n"
	.string "is down there.$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanIntro::
	.string "Keep me company.\p"
	.string "I've been out\n"
	.string "here alone for\p"
	.string "too long.\p"
	.string "Time moves wrong\n"
	.string "over this water.$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanDefeat::
	.string "You stayed.$"

Route21_South_Text_NolanPostBattle::
	.string "Thank you.\p"
	.string "Loneliness out here\n"
	.string "feels like something\p"
	.string "is listening.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilIntro::
	.string "LIL: A battle?\n"
	.string "Can't you do it alone?\p"
	.string "LIL: I've been asking\n"
	.string "my brother that\p"
	.string "for two days.\p"
	.string "LIL: Neither of us\n"
	.string "can move alone here.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilDefeat::
	.string "LIL: We moved.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilPostBattle::
	.string "LIL: Together we\n"
	.string "can leave.\p"
	.string "LIL: Alone we couldn't.$"

Route21_North_Text_LilNotEnoughMons::
	.string "LIL: Huh? A battle?\n"
	.string "I can't be bothered to do it alone.\l"
	.string "Bring two POKéMON, won't you?$"

Route21_North_Text_IanIntro::
	.string "IAN: My sister doesn't\n"
	.string "get enough exercise.\p"
	.string "IAN: Neither do I.\p"
	.string "IAN: Something on this\n"
	.string "route drains us\p"
	.string "when we stop moving.$"

Route21_North_Text_IanDefeat::
	.string "IAN: Keep moving.$"

Route21_North_Text_IanPostBattle::
	.string "IAN: Don't stop\n"
	.string "swimming out here.\p"
	.string "IAN: Even to rest.$"

Route21_North_Text_IanNotEnoughMons::
	.string "IAN: We want a two-on-two battle.\n"
	.string "So can you bring two POKéMON?$"
